OL,3,AFormer Hamas bodyguard guilty of UK
OL,4,Aknife attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 40-year-old was found guilty by
OL,7,Fmajority verdict of unlawfully wounding
OL,8,Fa bailiff who had come to repossess his
OL,9,Fwife's car, possession of two knives
OL,10,Fand criminal damage. He was cleared of
OL,11,Fwounding with intent.
OL,13,FAlfatih was under surveillance by a
OL,14,Fcounter-terror unit at the moment he
OL,15,Fattacked the bailiff in Birmingham last
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
